DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
14529::$$$message_0114_0000_0000$$$::I move around the park while humming.[lr]::
14530::$$$message_0114_0000_0001$$$::It was an afternoon patrol without any results, but I'm not unsatisfied.[lr]::
14531::$$$message_0114_0000_0002$$$::After all, it's a perfect sunny day.[lr]::
14532::$$$message_0114_0000_0003$$$::There's no doubt that my footsteps are also light and bouncy.::
14533::$$$message_0114_0001_0000$$$::"Hmm, nothing's happening, but this is fine."[lr]::
14534::$$$message_0114_0001_0001$$$::Happiness is rather cheap.[lr]::
14535::$$$message_0114_0001_0002$$$::I want to slowly take in my happiness among strangers on days like this.[lr]::
14536::$$$message_0114_0001_0003$$$::Man, on a peaceful afternoon like this, I don't want to[fadein time=300 storage=black][rep fliplr=0 storages=凛私服05b(中),セイバー私服01a(中) time=300 flipud=0 poss=r,l bg=black indexes=1000,2000][wait canskip=0 time=400][rep fliplr=0 storages=凛私服06d(中),セイバー私服13a(中) time=300 flipud=0 poss=r,l bg=black indexes=1000,2000] run into this pair,[lr]::
14537::$$$message_0114_0001_0004$$$::[wait canskip=0 time=400][rep fliplr=0 storages=桜私服04c(中),ライダー私服01d(中) time=300 flipud=0 poss=l,r bg=black indexes=1000,2000]or this pair please, I beg of you, God[line len=3]::
14538::$$$message_0114_0002_0000$$$::[line len=3]What was that just now?[lr]::
14539::$$$message_0114_0002_0001$$$::I feel like something rather physical for an oracle got tangled around my right ankle.::
14540::$$$message_0114_0003_0000$$$::"...No. No way, no freaking way."[lr]::
14541::$$$message_0114_0003_0001$$$::I complain as much as I can while crossing my heart.[lr]::
14542::$$$message_0114_0003_0002$$$::In an instant,[lr]::
14543::$$$message_0114_0003_0003$$$::Shirou Emiya is reeled in somewhere in public, without being noticed by anyone.::
14544::$$$message_0114_0004_0000$$$::"...Fish!"[lr]::
14545::$$$message_0114_0004_0001$$$::I roll over on the tiled floor.[lr]::
14546::$$$message_0114_0004_0002$$$::I stop spinning (abduction complete),[lr]::
14547::$$$message_0114_0004_0003$$$::the red string disappears as if nothing happened (destruction of evidence),[lr]::
14548::$$$message_0114_0004_0004$$$::and the girl who is clearly the main culprit greets the catch acting like she had nothing to do with it.::
14549::$$$message_0114_0005_0000$$$::"Good day. What a coincidence, Shirou Emiya."[lr]::
14550::$$$message_0114_0005_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
14551::$$$message_0114_0005_0002$$$::I stand up while brushing off dust.[lr]::
14552::$$$message_0114_0005_0003$$$::Of course, with unwavering scornful eyes as if to say, "What's going on? I'm ready to fight unless you give me a good excuse or two."::
14553::$$$message_0114_0006_0000$$$::"Oh? Is there anything wrong? It does not seem like you have any external wounds as far as I can see."[lr]::
14554::$$$message_0114_0006_0001$$$::Guh, defensive strength of steel.[lr]::
14555::$$$message_0114_0006_0002$$$::It seems like my glare isn't enough to cause any damage on the girl.::
14556::$$$message_0114_0007_0000$$$::"...That's right. I forgot that she never feels any remorse at all unless it's her own failure..."[lr]::
14557::$$$message_0114_0007_0001$$$::To be exact, her own failure that she screwed up herself.[lr]::
14558::$$$message_0114_0007_0002$$$::She will only reflect on her actions when it's something that she feels at fault for.[lr]::
14559::$$$message_0114_0007_0003$$$::So, this action must seem "correct" to her.::
14560::$$$message_0114_0008_0000$$$::"Hey. Were you the type of person to do stuff like this?"[lr]::
14561::$$$message_0114_0008_0001$$$::"I usually do not, but it was your request this time.[lr]::
14562::$$$message_0114_0008_0002$$$::You told me to talk to you if I have the time."[lr]::
14563::$$$message_0114_0008_0003$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
14564::$$$message_0114_0008_0004$$$::I tilt my head in confusion.::
14565::$$$message_0114_0009_0000$$$::"What? Did I ever say myself that I wanted you to do this kind of thing to me?"[lr]::
14566::$$$message_0114_0009_0001$$$::"You certainly did. You told me to capture you using my Holy Shroud that I'm good at using."[lr]::
14567::$$$message_0114_0009_0002$$$::"Mrgh."[lr]::
14568::$$$message_0114_0009_0003$$$::...Hmm. I don't recall, but it's starting to sound like I've brought this upon myself.::
14569::$$$message_0114_0010_0000$$$::"...Got it. I'm not aware of it, but that's my mistake. I'd like for you to talk to me normally from now on."[lr]::
14570::$$$message_0114_0010_0001$$$::"Yes. I, too, was worried about whether we would be able to have a normal conversation in this kind of situation."[lr]::
14571::$$$message_0114_0010_0002$$$::She's almost getting it.[lr]::
14572::$$$message_0114_0010_0003$$$::She's right to feel worried about that.[lr]::
14573::$$$message_0114_0010_0004$$$::It's correct, so I want her to worry about whether it's okay for her to do something like this from now on.::
14574::$$$message_0114_0011_0000$$$::"...Phew. Anyway, hello, Caren. How rare for us to meet at a place like this."[lr]::
14575::$$$message_0114_0011_0001$$$::"Yes. I also did not think that I'd be able to speak with you at this hour."[lr]::
14576::$$$message_0114_0011_0002$$$::"Yeah, you were saying something like that. Was it... You have to be at the church during the day or something?[lr]::
14577::$$$message_0114_0011_0003$$$::Is it all right for you to be here right now?"::
14578::$$$message_0114_0012_0000$$$::"There's exceptions to anything. It's not impossible to even go out into town for a bit."[lr]::
14579::$$$message_0114_0012_0001$$$::"I see. Then, can you come visit our place if you try?"::
14580::$$$message_0114_0013_0000$$$::"That would be... difficult after all. Besides, it seems that I don't get along well with any of those girls."[lr]::
14581::$$$message_0114_0013_0001$$$::"Really? ...Hmm, it doesn't look like that."[lr]::
14582::$$$message_0114_0013_0002$$$::I feel like she'd get along pretty well with Tohsaka.[lr]::
14583::$$$message_0114_0013_0003$$$::Although it's not like I have any definite reason for this.::
14584::$$$message_0114_0014_0000$$$::"Well, come visit if you feel like it. I'll welcome you with tea if you're okay with that.[lr]::
14585::$$$message_0114_0014_0001$$$::So. Your method of getting me here was insane, but you must have something to talk about if you called me over. What did you want to talk about, Caren?"[lr]::
14586::$$$message_0114_0014_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Is this something to get surprised over?[font italic=false]::
14587::$$$message_0114_0015_0000$$$::"What wrong? ...Um, do you not feel well when you're out of the church after all?"[lr]::
14588::$$$message_0114_0015_0001$$$::"No, that is not it... You are more gentlemanly than usual, so it is just different from what I am used to."::
14589::$$$message_0114_0016_0000$$$::I haven't talked with Caren enough for her to say "more than usual."[lr]::
14590::$$$message_0114_0016_0001$$$::Oh, well[line len=3]I might've heard her performance several times already[line len=3]::
14591::$$$message_0114_0017_0000$$$::"My bad. Is this our first time talking like this...?"[lr]::
14592::$$$message_0114_0017_0001$$$::"Yes. It is our first time talking like this in this place.[lr]::
14593::$$$message_0114_0017_0002$$$::We both know each other's names, so we must have met each other several times before.[lr]::
14594::$$$message_0114_0017_0003$$$::...Please do not worry about me."::
14595::$$$message_0114_0018_0000$$$::"...I see, so you're feeling fine.[lr]::
14596::$$$message_0114_0018_0001$$$::So, about the reason you called me over..."[lr]::
14597::$$$message_0114_0018_0002$$$::"I do not have that much of a reason. There is nothing that we need to talk about either, so I was going to pass by you even if I saw you, but... I couldn't help it since you seemed happy."[lr]::
14598::$$$message_0114_0018_0003$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
14599::$$$message_0114_0018_0004$$$::...I wonder why.[lr]::
14600::$$$message_0114_0018_0005$$$::I feel like that just sent chills down my spine.::
14601::$$$message_0114_0019_0000$$$::"Y-You couldn't help it since I seemed happy?"[lr]::
14602::$$$message_0114_0019_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Um, what did that make her want to do...?[font italic=false]::
14603::$$$message_0114_0020_0000$$$::"I couldn't help that it stimulated my sadistic desires.[lr]::
14604::$$$message_0114_0020_0001$$$::You looked visibly happy for no reason, so I wanted to let you know the current situation.[lr]::
14605::$$$message_0114_0020_0002$$$::Let you know that life isn't something easy, but something that's always weighed down by self-torture writhing in agony. That I can easily erase that make believe happiness with my one breath." ::
14606::$$$message_0114_0021_0000$$$::"...Umm.[lr]::
14607::$$$message_0114_0021_0001$$$::Does that mean you don't like me?"::
14608::$$$message_0114_0022_0000$$$::"No, it does not mean that I hate you. Whenever I see happy looking people, it just makes me want to take them down a peg.[lr]::
14609::$$$message_0114_0022_0001$$$::...Let's see. There were signs from before, but I feel like it went into full swing since I came to this town... Could this be my hobby?"::
14610::$$$message_0114_0023_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14611::$$$message_0114_0023_0001$$$::It's troubling for her to ask me.[lr]::
14612::$$$message_0114_0023_0002$$$::It troubles me, but my feelings are clear.::
14613::$$$message_0114_0024_0000$$$::"I see. [line len=3]That sucks."[lr]::
14614::$$$message_0114_0024_0001$$$::"I agree. Oh dear, I wonder who I take after."[lr]::
14615::$$$message_0114_0024_0002$$$::We both nod.[lr]::
14616::$$$message_0114_0024_0003$$$::A sense of affinity from finding a mutual enemy.::
14617::$$$message_0114_0025_0000$$$::"But, I want you to overlook my little happiness if possible. Will you at least let me spend my short leisure time peacefully?"::
14618::$$$message_0114_0026_0000$$$::"...I cannot force you when you put it like that.[lr]::
14619::$$$message_0114_0026_0001$$$::As far as I can see, it seems like something that will go away quickly, so there should be no need for me to throw a wet blanket on it."::
14620::$$$message_0114_0027_0000$$$::Caren turns on her heel, clearly unsatisfied.[lr]::
14621::$$$message_0114_0027_0001$$$::She's like some child that had her favorite toy taken away.::
14622::$$$message_0114_0028_0000$$$::"[line len=3]I forgot to ask one thing.[lr]::
14623::$$$message_0114_0028_0001$$$::Have you seen a suspicious duo around here? A tall one and a short one. They stand out, so I don't think I would need to describe their specific characteristics."[lr]::
14624::$$$message_0114_0028_0002$$$::"A suspicious duo? ...No, I haven't seen them."::
14625::$$$message_0114_0029_0000$$$::"Is that so? I felt like they were around here, but they may have moved.[lr]::
14626::$$$message_0114_0029_0001$$$::How dare they think they can escape from me? Such despicable familiars."[lr]::
14627::$$$message_0114_0029_0002$$$::The sister laughs politely.[lr]::
14628::$$$message_0114_0029_0003$$$::Umm, you are the most suspicious one right now.::
14629::$$$message_0114_0030_0000$$$::"Goodbye, Shirou Emiya. We shall meet at the church if our paths cross again in the future."[lr]::
14630::$$$message_0114_0030_0001$$$::She walks away.[lr]::
14631::$$$message_0114_0030_0002$$$::She leaves the park not as the phantom of a girl in vestments, but as a real person.::
914553::$$$message_9114_0006_0000$$$::"Oh? Is there anything wrong? It does not seem like you have any external wounds as far as I can see."[r]::�